---
title: Face Recognition Request
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client (WordPress / internal caller)
    participant API as FastAPI /embeddings
    participant RecSvc as FaceRecognitionService
    participant EmbedRouter as EmbeddingRouterAdapter
    participant Hybrid as HybridIndexManager
    participant Model as InsightFaceAdapter

    Client->>API: POST /api/v0/embeddings {image, threshold?}
    API->>API: validate payload + load image
    API->>RecSvc: recognize_faces(image, threshold?)
    RecSvc->>EmbedRouter: reload_if_needed()
    EmbedRouter->>Hybrid: maybe_reload()
    Hybrid-->>EmbedRouter: embeddings cached
    RecSvc->>Model: analyze(image)
    Model-->>RecSvc: face_embeddings[]
    loop per face_embedding
        RecSvc->>EmbedRouter: find_matches(embedding, threshold)
        EmbedRouter-->>RecSvc: matches (top candidates)
    end
    RecSvc-->>API: RecognitionResult (detections, embeddings, matches)
    API-->>Client: 200 OK {faces: [...], threshold, processing_time_ms}
